# Where the FastAPI backend lives, as seen from the device running the app.
#
# Leave this unset and the app figures it out: on a physical device it reuses
# the host serving the Metro bundle (your machine's LAN IP), and falls back to
# the address baked into src/api/client.ts.
#
# Set it when the backend is somewhere else, or when the fallback IP goes
# stale (it is DHCP-assigned).
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.29.10:8000
